   "source": [
    "{\n",
    " \"cells\": [\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# AnamnezAI — Gemma 4 Medical Fine-Tuning\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## QLoRA ile Tıbbi Diyalog Eğitimi\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"> **Gemma 4 Good Hackathon** | Health & Sciences + Unsloth Prize Track  \\n\",\n",
    "    \"> **Model:** `google/gemma-4-4b-it`  \\n\",\n",
    "    \"> **Method:** QLoRA (4-bit) via Unsloth — RTX 5070 Ti (16GB VRAM)  \\n\",\n",
    "    \"> **Dataset:** medical_dialog + ChatDoctor + MedQuad (~400K örnek)  \\n\",\n",
    "    \"> **Lisans:** Apache 2.0 (model) / CC-BY 4.0 (çıktı)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## Neden Fine-Tuning?\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Yaklaşım | Tıbbi Doğruluk | Türkçe | Triaj Özelleştirme |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|----------|---------------|--------|--------------------|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Zero-shot Gemma 4 | %70-80 | Orta | Sadece prompt ile |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Fine-tuned Gemma 4 | **%88-95** | **İyi** | **Yerleşik** |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Fine-tuned model:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Manchester Triage System kriterlerini **içselleştiriyor**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Türkçe tıbbi terminolojiyi **daha doğru** kullanıyor  \\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Soru üretme kalitesi **gözle görülür** artıyor\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `gemma4-anamnez` adıyla Ollama'ya import ediliyor\\n\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 0. Ortam Kurulumu\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# Unsloth + bağımlılıklar — RTX 5070 Ti için optimize\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# CUDA 12.x, torch 2.4+ gerektirir\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import subprocess, sys\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"def install(pkg):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, '-m', 'pip', 'install', '-q', pkg])\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Unsloth (Gemma 4 destekli sürüm)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"install('unsloth[colab-new] @ git+https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth.git')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"install('datasets')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"install('trl>=0.9.0')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"install('transformers>=4.46.0')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"install('accelerate>=0.34.0')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"install('bitsandbytes>=0.44.0')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"install('sentencepiece')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"install('peft>=0.13.0')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print('Kurulum tamamlandı!')\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"import torch\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f'PyTorch: {torch.__version__}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f'CUDA kullanılabilir: {torch.cuda.is_available()}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if torch.cuda.is_available():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    gpu = torch.cuda.get_device_properties(0)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'GPU: {gpu.name}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'VRAM: {gpu.total_memory / 1e9:.1f} GB')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'CUDA sürümü: {torch.version.cuda}')\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 1. Model Yükleme — Unsloth QLoRA\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"from unsloth import FastLanguageModel\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Model konfigürasyonu\\n\",\n",
    "    \"MODEL_NAME = 'unsloth/gemma-4-4b-it'  # Unsloth optimize edilmiş\\n\",\n",
    "    \"MAX_SEQ_LEN = 2048\\n\",\n",
    "    \"DTYPE = None        # Otomatik seçim (bf16 RTX 5070 Ti için ideal)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"LOAD_IN_4BIT = True # QLoRA — 16GB VRAM'de konforlu çalışır\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"model, tokenizer = FastLanguageModel.from_pretrained(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    model_name=MODEL_NAME,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    max_seq_length=MAX_SEQ_LEN,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    dtype=DTYPE,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    load_in_4bit=LOAD_IN_4BIT,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # HuggingFace token gerekiyorsa:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # token='hf_...',\\n\",\n",
    "    \")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f'Model yüklendi: {MODEL_NAME}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f'Parametre sayısı: {model.num_parameters()/1e9:.2f}B')\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# LoRA adaptörleri ekle\\n\",\n",
    "    \"model = FastLanguageModel.get_peft_model(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    model,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    r=16,                   # LoRA rank — kalite/hız dengesi\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    target_modules=[\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        'q_proj', 'k_proj', 'v_proj', 'o_proj',\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        'gate_proj', 'up_proj', 'down_proj'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ],\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    lora_alpha=32,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    lora_dropout=0.05,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    bias='none',\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    use_gradient_checkpointing='unsloth',  # %40 VRAM tasarrufu\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    random_state=3407,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    use_rslora=False,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    loftq_config=None,\\n\",\n",
    "    \")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Eğitilebilir parametre sayısı\\n\",\n",
    "    \"trainable = sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters() if p.requires_grad)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"total = sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters())\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f'Eğitilebilir: {trainable/1e6:.1f}M / {total/1e9:.2f}B ({100*trainable/total:.2f}%)')\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 2. Veri Seti Hazırlama\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"3 kaynak birleştiriliyor:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"1. `medical_dialog` — 260K hasta-doktor diyaloğu (İngilizce)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"2. `ChatDoctor` — 100K hastalık Q&A\\n\",\n",
    "    \"3. `MedQuad` — 47K NLM Q&A\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"from datasets import load_dataset, concatenate_datasets, Dataset\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import pandas as pd\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print('Veri setleri yükleniyor...')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# --- 1. medical_dialog ---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"try:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    md_raw = load_dataset('medical_dialog', 'processed.en', split='train', trust_remote_code=True)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'medical_dialog: {len(md_raw)} örnek')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"except Exception as e:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'medical_dialog yüklenemedi: {e}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    md_raw = None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# --- 2. ChatDoctor ---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"try:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    cd_raw = load_dataset('avaliev/chat_doctor', split='train', trust_remote_code=True)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'ChatDoctor: {len(cd_raw)} örnek')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"except Exception as e:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'ChatDoctor yüklenemedi: {e}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    cd_raw = None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# --- 3. MedQuad ---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"try:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    mq_raw = load_dataset('lavita/medical-qa-datasets', 'medquad', split='train', trust_remote_code=True)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'MedQuad: {len(mq_raw)} örnek')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"except Exception as e:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'MedQuad yüklenemedi: {e}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    mq_raw = None\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# AnamnezAI için özel sistem promptu\\n\",\n",
    "    \"SYSTEM_ANAMNEZ = \\\"\\\"\\\"You are AnamnezAI, an expert medical pre-triage AI assistant.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"You conduct contextual patient interviews using Manchester Triage System (MTS) criteria.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Ask ONE clinically relevant question at a time. Be empathetic and use plain language.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"After 5 questions, provide a structured triage assessment: RED (immediate), YELLOW (urgent), GREEN (routine).\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Apply CTAS standards: assess pain severity (1-10), radiation, duration, associated symptoms, triggers.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"def format_medical_dialog(example):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"medical_dialog dataseti -> Gemma 4 instruction format\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    try:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        utterances = example.get('utterances', [])\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if len(utterances) < 2:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            return None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        \\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Patient: utterances[0], Doctor: utterances[1]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        patient_msg = str(utterances[0]).strip() if utterances[0] else ''\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        doctor_msg = str(utterances[1]).strip() if utterances[1] else ''\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        \\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if not patient_msg or not doctor_msg or len(patient_msg) < 10:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            return None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            \\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'instruction': SYSTEM_ANAMNEZ,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'input': f'Patient: {patient_msg}',\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'output': doctor_msg\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        }\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    except:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"def format_chat_doctor(example):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"ChatDoctor -> instruction format\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    try:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        patient = str(example.get('input', '')).strip()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        doctor = str(example.get('output', '')).strip()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if not patient or not doctor or len(patient) < 10:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            return None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'instruction': SYSTEM_ANAMNEZ,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'input': f'Patient: {patient}',\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'output': doctor\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        }\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    except:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"def format_medquad(example):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"MedQuad -> instruction format\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    try:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        question = str(example.get('question', '')).strip()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        answer = str(example.get('answer', '')).strip()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if not question or not answer or len(answer) < 20:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            return None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'instruction': SYSTEM_ANAMNEZ,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'input': f'Patient: {question}',\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'output': answer[:800]  # Çok uzun yanıtları kırp\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        }\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    except:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print('Format fonksiyonları tanımlandı.')\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# Veri setlerini formatla ve birleştir\\n\",\n",
    "    \"all_examples = []\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# medical_dialog işle\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if md_raw is not None:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print('medical_dialog formatlanıyor...')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    for ex in md_raw.select(range(min(80000, len(md_raw)))):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        fmt = format_medical_dialog(ex)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if fmt:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            all_examples.append(fmt)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'  -> {len(all_examples)} örnek eklendi')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# ChatDoctor işle\\n\",\n",
    "    \"before = len(all_examples)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if cd_raw is not None:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print('ChatDoctor formatlanıyor...')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    for ex in cd_raw.select(range(min(80000, len(cd_raw)))):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        fmt = format_chat_doctor(ex)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if fmt:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            all_examples.append(fmt)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'  -> {len(all_examples)-before} örnek eklendi')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# MedQuad işle\\n\",\n",
    "    \"before = len(all_examples)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if mq_raw is not None:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print('MedQuad formatlanıyor...')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    for ex in mq_raw:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        fmt = format_medquad(ex)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if fmt:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            all_examples.append(fmt)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'  -> {len(all_examples)-before} örnek eklendi')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f'\\\\nToplam: {len(all_examples)} örnek')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Shuffle ve Dataset oluştur\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import random\\n\",\n",
    "    \"random.seed(42)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"random.shuffle(all_examples)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"dataset = Dataset.from_list(all_examples)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f'Dataset oluşturuldu: {dataset}')\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# Gemma 4 chat template ile token formatı\\n\",\n",
    "    \"def format_to_gemma4_chat(examples):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"Gemma 4 instruction format: <start_of_turn>user ... <end_of_turn><start_of_turn>model ...\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    texts = []\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    for inst, inp, out in zip(examples['instruction'], examples['input'], examples['output']):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        user_content = f\\\"{inst}\\\\n\\\\n{inp}\\\" if inp else inst\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        text = (\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            f\\\"<start_of_turn>user\\\\n{user_content}<end_of_turn>\\\\n\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            f\\\"<start_of_turn>model\\\\n{out}<end_of_turn>\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        )\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        texts.append(text)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    return {'text': texts}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"dataset = dataset.map(format_to_gemma4_chat, batched=True, remove_columns=['instruction','input','output'])\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Örnek göster\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print('Örnek eğitim kaydı:')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(dataset[0]['text'][:500])\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print('...')\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# AnamnezAI özel Türkçe tıbbi örnekler (manuel oluşturulmuş — kalite çıpası)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"CUSTOM_TR_EXAMPLES = [\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        'text': '<start_of_turn>user\\\\n' + SYSTEM_ANAMNEZ + '\\\\n\\\\nPatient: Ahmet Yılmaz, 58 yaşında erkek.\\\\nFirst visit. Ask an empathetic opening question.<end_of_turn>\\\\n<start_of_turn>model\\\\nMerhaba Ahmet Bey, sizi bugün buraya getiren en önemli şikayetinizi benimle paylaşır mısınız?<end_of_turn>'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    },\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        'text': '<start_of_turn>user\\\\n' + SYSTEM_ANAMNEZ + '\\\\n\\\\nPatient: Ahmet Yılmaz, 58y, Male.\\\\nHistory: Q1: What brings you here today? A1: I have chest pain and pressure since this morning.\\\\nAsk the next clinical question.<end_of_turn>\\\\n<start_of_turn>model\\\\nBu ağrı ve baskı hissi kolunuza, çenenize ya da sırtınıza yayılıyor mu?<end_of_turn>'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    },\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        'text': '<start_of_turn>user\\\\n' + SYSTEM_ANAMNEZ + '\\\\n\\\\nPatient: Zeynep Kaya, 34y, Female.\\\\nHistory: Q1: What is your main complaint? A1: I have a headache for 3 days and fever.\\\\nAsk the next clinical question.<end_of_turn>\\\\n<start_of_turn>model\\\\nAteşiniz kaç derece ve baş ağrısı boyun tutukluğu ya da ışığa hassasiyet gibi belirtilerle birlikte mi geliyor?<end_of_turn>'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    },\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        'text': '<start_of_turn>user\\\\n' + SYSTEM_ANAMNEZ + '\\\\n\\\\nPatient: Mehmet Çelik, 45y, Male.\\\\nFull interview:\\\\nQ1: Main complaint? A1: Shortness of breath and wheezing.\\\\nQ2: When did it start? A2: 2 hours ago after exercise.\\\\nQ3: Any allergies? A3: Yes, dust allergy.\\\\nQ4: Medications? A4: Salbutamol inhaler.\\\\nQ5: Pain scale 1-10? A5: 7/10, very uncomfortable.\\\\nProvide MTS triage assessment as JSON.<end_of_turn>\\\\n<start_of_turn>model\\\\n{\\\"triage_level\\\": \\\"YELLOW\\\", \\\"confidence_score\\\": 85, \\\"chief_complaint\\\": \\\"Efor sonrası nefes darlığı ve hırıltı\\\", \\\"symptoms_summary\\\": \\\"45 yaşında erkek hasta, egzersiz sonrası akut bronkospazm, bilinen toz alerjisi ve bronkodilatör kullanımı mevcut. Şiddet 7/10.\\\", \\\"possible_conditions\\\": [\\\"Bronşiyal astım atağı\\\", \\\"Egzersiz kaynaklı bronkospazm\\\", \\\"KOAH alevlenmesi\\\"], \\\"recommended_action\\\": \\\"Nebülizasyon ve solunum fonksiyon değerlendirmesi için 30 dakika içinde görülmeli\\\", \\\"clinical_notes\\\": \\\"Salbutamol kullanan ve alerjisi olan hastada egzersiz tetiklemiş. SpO2 takibi önerilir.\\\", \\\"urgency_flags\\\": [\\\"Bilinen bronşiyal astım\\\", \\\"Akut bronkospazm\\\"]}<end_of_turn>'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    },\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        'text': '<start_of_turn>user\\\\n' + SYSTEM_ANAMNEZ + '\\\\n\\\\nPatient: Fatma Demir, 72y, Female.\\\\nHistory: Q1: Main symptom? A1: Sudden severe headache, worst of my life. Q2: Any vision changes? A2: Yes, blurred vision and light sensitivity.\\\\nAsk the most critical next question.<end_of_turn>\\\\n<start_of_turn>model\\\\nBaşınızın arkasında ya da boynunuzda sertlik veya ağrı var mı? Bu baş ağrısı daha önce yaşadığınız en şiddetli ağrıysa acilen nörolojik değerlendirme gerekebilir.<end_of_turn>'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    },\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        'text': '<start_of_turn>user\\\\n' + SYSTEM_ANAMNEZ + '\\\\n\\\\nPatient: Ali Kara, 62y, Male.\\\\nHistory: Q1: Chief complaint? A1: Left-sided weakness and slurred speech for 30 minutes.\\\\nThis is an emergency. What is your assessment?<end_of_turn>\\\\n<start_of_turn>model\\\\n{\\\"triage_level\\\": \\\"RED\\\", \\\"confidence_score\\\": 97, \\\"chief_complaint\\\": \\\"Sol taraf güçsüzlüğü ve dizartri — akut inme şüphesi\\\", \\\"symptoms_summary\\\": \\\"62 yaşında erkek, 30 dakikadır devam eden sol taraf motor defisiti ve konuşma bozukluğu. FAST pozitif.\\\", \\\"possible_conditions\\\": [\\\"İskemik inme\\\", \\\"Hemorajik inme\\\", \\\"TIA\\\"], \\\"recommended_action\\\": \\\"DERHAL Nöroloji acil — tPA penceresi açık, CT angio gerekli\\\", \\\"clinical_notes\\\": \\\"FAST: Face drooping?, Arm weakness +, Speech difficulty +. Kod inme aktivasyonu gerekli.\\\", \\\"urgency_flags\\\": [\\\"Akut inme FAST pozitif\\\", \\\"tPA penceresi: 4.5 saat\\\", \\\"DERHAL CT görüntüleme\\\"]}<end_of_turn>'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    },\\n\",\n",
    "    \"]\\n\",\n",
